# =================================================================
# Cpro Hub / BuildHub Web - Production Environment Variables
# =================================================================
# If VITE_API_URL is specified here or in Railway Variables, Vite will bundle it.
# If omitted or empty, the app dynamically detects your live domain at runtime
# (e.g. Railway sibling API services, cpromark.com CloudFront, or same-origin /api/v1)
# and will NEVER fall back to localhost in production.
#
# To override for your specific deployment, uncomment and edit:
# VITE_API_URL=https://cprohub-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1
# VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://cprohub-api-production.up.railway.app

